          <p>The interaction component was a timed task involving throwing and catching Frisbees and using the caught Frisbees -- which had letterforms on them -- to clue one of the words on a randomly selected card containing five possibilities.  For each success, the team was awarded 6 "collectible cards", and was told that they did not need to collect them all, but more was generally better. Getting the second set required successful completion using fewer Frisbees, less time, and greater distance, and getting the third set was similarly a bit harder. The collectible cards are shown below:</p>
